<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Prior Authorization Story Simulator</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

:root{
  --bg:#0f172a;
  --card:#ffffff;
  --card-border:#e2e8f0;
  --text:#0f172a;
  --text-2:#475569;
  --text-3:#94a3b8;
  --blue:#2563eb;
  --blue-light:#eff6ff;
  --blue-border:#bfdbfe;
  --blue-dark:#1e3a8a;
  --teal:#0d9488;
  --amber:#d97706;
  --red:#dc2626;
  --green:#16a34a;
  --radius:14px;
  --shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.10),0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}

html{scroll-behavior:smooth}

body{
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  min-height:100vh;
  background:#0f172a;
  color:var(--text);
}

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero{
  position:relative;
  min-height:260px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:flex-end;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-bg{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?w=1400&q=80&fit=crop');
  background-size:cover;
  background-position:center 40%;
  filter:brightness(0.45) saturate(0.8);
}
.hero-overlay{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(15,23,42,0.2) 0%, rgba(15,23,42,0.85) 100%);
}
.hero-content{
  position:relative;z-index:2;
  width:100%;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;
  padding:2rem 1.25rem 2rem;
}
.hero-eyebrow{
  font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:rgba(148,163,184,.9);margin-bottom:.6rem;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.hero-eyebrow::before{content:'';display:block;width:24px;height:2px;background:#2563eb;border-radius:2px;}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,2rem);font-weight:700;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.02em;
  line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:.5rem;
}
.hero-sub{font-size:.875rem;color:rgba(203,213,225,.85);line-height:1.6;max-width:480px;}
.hero-chars{
  display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:1.1rem;
}
.hero-char{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  border-radius:99px;padding:5px 12px 5px 5px;
  font-size:.78rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);font-weight:500;
}
.hero-char .av{
  width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;
}

/* ── MAIN SHELL ── */
.shell{
  max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;
  padding:1.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
}

/* ── PROGRESS ── */
.progress-card{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1rem 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom:1.25rem;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.progress-top{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:.75rem;
}
.scene-num{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;}
.scene-label{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:-.01em;}
.scene-pct{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);}
.progress-track{height:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;}
.progress-fill{
  height:100%;background:var(--blue);border-radius:99px;
  transition:width .6s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
}

/* scene dots */
.scene-dots{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-top:.65rem;}
.sdot{
  height:4px;flex:1;border-radius:2px;background:#e2e8f0;
  transition:background .4s;
}
.sdot.done{background:#93c5fd;}
.sdot.active{background:var(--blue);}

/* ── CHAT CARD ── */
.chat-card{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);margin-bottom:1rem;
}
.chat-topbar{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  padding:.75rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;
  background:#fafafa;
}
.chat-topbar-icon{font-size:1.1rem;}
.chat-topbar-title{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);flex:1;}
.chat-topbar-tag{
  font-size:.68rem;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:99px;
  background:#f0fdf4;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;
}
.chat-topbar-tag.denied{background:#fef2f2;color:#b91c1c;border-color:#fecaca;}
.chat-topbar-tag.pending{background:#fffbeb;color:#b45309;border-color:#fde68a;}

#chat-feed{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;
  padding:1rem;min-height:120px;
}

/* ── MESSAGES ── */
.narrator{
  text-align:center;
  font-family:'Lora',serif;font-style:italic;
  font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-3);
  padding:2px 1.5rem;line-height:1.65;
}
.narrator-sep{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  margin:2px 0;
}
.narrator-sep .line{flex:1;height:1px;background:#f1f5f9;}
.narrator-sep .txt{
  font-family:'Lora',serif;font-style:italic;
  font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-3);white-space:nowrap;
}

.bubble-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;}
.bubble-row.right{flex-direction:row-reverse;}

.av-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;flex-shrink:0;}
.avatar{
  width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:19px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
}
.av-name{font-size:.62rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.02em;}

.bubble{
  max-width:72%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:16px;
  font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text);
}
.bubble.left{
  background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;
}
.bubble.right{
  background:var(--blue-light);border:1px solid var(--blue-border);
  border-bottom-right-radius:4px;color:var(--blue-dark);
}
.bubble strong{font-weight:600;}
.bubble .cite{
  display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:.75rem;font-style:italic;
  color:#64748b;padding:6px 10px;background:#f8fafc;
  border-left:3px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;
}
.bubble .flow-box{
  margin:8px 0 2px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;
  border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:.77rem;
  color:#0369a1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.bubble .flow-box span{font-weight:600;}
.bubble .flow-box .arr{color:#7dd3fc;font-size:1rem;}

.bubble .stat-row{display:flex;gap:7px;margin:8px 0 2px;}
.bubble .stat-c{
  flex:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;
  padding:8px 10px;
}
.bubble .stat-c strong{display:block;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue-dark);}
.bubble .stat-c span{font-size:.72rem;color:#64748b;}

.bubble .info-box{
  margin:8px 0 2px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;
  border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:.78rem;color:#15803d;
}
.bubble .warn-box{
  margin:8px 0 2px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;
  border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:.78rem;color:#92400e;
}
.bubble .ref-box{
  margin:8px 0 2px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;
  border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:.78rem;color:#4c1d95;
  font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.03em;
}
.bubble .step-list{margin:6px 0 2px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
.bubble .step-item{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:.82rem;
  padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.15);
}
.bubble .step-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.bubble .step-num{
  flex-shrink:0;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:1px;
}
.bubble .step-text strong{display:block;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1px;}

/* typing indicator */
.typing-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;}
.typing-row.right{flex-direction:row-reverse;}
.typing-bubble{
  background:var(--blue-light);border:1px solid var(--blue-border);
  border-radius:16px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;
  padding:12px 16px;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;
}
.typing-bubble .dot{
  width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#93c5fd;
  animation:tdot 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;
}
.typing-bubble .dot:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s;}
.typing-bubble .dot:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s;}
@keyframes tdot{0%,80%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}40%{transform:translateY(-5px);}}

/* ── CHOICES ── */
.choices-area{margin-bottom:1rem;}
.choices-label{
  font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;
  color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:.6rem;padding-left:2px;
}
.choices-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;}
.choice-btn{
  width:100%;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:10px;
  border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;
  color:var(--text);font-size:.845rem;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  cursor:pointer;text-align:left;line-height:1.5;
  transition:border-color .15s,background .15s,transform .1s;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
}
.choice-btn:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:#93c5fd;background:var(--blue-light);transform:translateX(2px);}
.choice-btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default;transform:none;}
.choice-btn.selected{border-color:var(--blue);background:var(--blue-light);color:var(--blue-dark);}
.choice-btn .cb-icon{
  width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#f1f5f9;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-3);flex-shrink:0;
  transition:background .15s,color .15s;
}
.choice-btn.selected .cb-icon{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;}

/* ── NEXT BUTTON ── */
#next-btn{
  display:none;width:100%;padding:13px;border-radius:10px;border:none;
  background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;
  font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;
  transition:background .15s,transform .1s;letter-spacing:-.01em;
}
#next-btn:hover{background:#1d4ed8;transform:translateY(-1px);}
#next-btn:active{transform:translateY(0);}

/* ── DONE BANNER ── */
.done-card{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e3a8a 100%);
  border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.75rem;
  color:#fff;text-align:center;margin-top:.5rem;
}
.done-card .done-icon{font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;}
.done-card h2{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.4rem;}
.done-card p{font-size:.84rem;color:rgba(203,213,225,.85);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.1rem;}
.done-card .done-stats{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:1.1rem;
}
.done-stat{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 8px;}
.done-stat strong{display:block;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;}
.done-stat span{font-size:.7rem;color:rgba(203,213,225,.75);}
.restart-btn{
  padding:10px 24px;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:#fff;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
  font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;
  transition:background .15s;
}
.restart-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);}

/* ── FADE-IN ── */
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(5px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
.new-msg{animation:fadeUp .22s ease both;}

@media(max-width:480px){
  .bubble{max-width:86%;}
  .hero-chars{flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .done-card .done-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Healthcare Education</div>
    <h1>Prior Authorization<br>Story Simulator</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Follow Rahul's real journey through the PA process — from diagnosis to final approval — in 8 interactive scenes.</p>
    <div class="hero-chars">
      <div class="hero-char"><div class="av">👦</div>Rahul — Patient</div>
      <div class="hero-char"><div class="av">👧</div>Priya — Healthcare Ops</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- MAIN -->
<div class="shell">

  <!-- PROGRESS -->
  <div class="progress-card">
    <div class="progress-top">
      <div>
        <div class="scene-num" id="prog-scene">Scene 1 of 8</div>
        <div class="scene-label" id="scene-label-text">Doctor Visit</div>
      </div>
      <div class="scene-pct" id="prog-pct">12%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-track">
      <div class="progress-fill" id="prog-bar" style="width:12%"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="scene-dots" id="scene-dots"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- CHAT -->
  <div class="chat-card">
    <div class="chat-topbar">
      <span class="chat-topbar-icon" id="topbar-icon">🏥</span>
      <span class="chat-topbar-title" id="topbar-title">City Medical Center</span>
      <span class="chat-topbar-tag" id="topbar-tag">Scene 1</span>
    </div>
    <div id="chat-feed"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- CHOICES -->
  <div class="choices-area" id="choices-area">
    <div class="choices-label">Choose how the story continues</div>
    <div class="choices-grid" id="choices"></div>
  </div>

  <button id="next-btn">Continue to next scene &rarr;</button>

</div>

<script>
const SCENE_META = [
  {icon:'🏥', label:'Doctor Visit',       tag:'Scene 1', tagClass:''},
  {icon:'📋', label:'PA Submitted',       tag:'Pending', tagClass:'pending'},
  {icon:'📚', label:'What is PA?',        tag:'Education', tagClass:''},
  {icon:'🔍', label:'Insurance Review',   tag:'Under Review', tagClass:'pending'},
  {icon:'🚫', label:'Denial',             tag:'Denied', tagClass:'denied'},
  {icon:'⚖️', label:'Appeal Filed',       tag:'Appeal', tagClass:'pending'},
  {icon:'✅', label:'Approved!',          tag:'Approved', tagClass:''},
  {icon:'💡', label:'Takeaways',          tag:'Complete', tagClass:''},
];

const SCENES = [
  {
    messages:[
      {type:'narrator-sep', text:'Rahul visits City Medical Center after months of joint pain'},
      {type:'left',  emoji:'👦', name:'Rahul', text:'Dr. Patel, my fingers and wrists have been swollen and stiff every morning. It\'s been getting worse for months — I can barely open a jar.'},
      {type:'narrator', text:'Dr. Patel runs blood work, anti-CCP antibody tests, and X-rays. Results come back positive.'},
      {type:'left',  emoji:'👦', name:'Rahul', text:'What exactly does the diagnosis mean for me?'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'<strong>Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA)</strong> is an autoimmune disease — your immune system mistakenly attacks your own joints, causing inflammation, pain, and over time, permanent damage. Dr. Patel has prescribed <strong>Humira (adalimumab)</strong>, a biologic medication that targets that inflammation at its source.'},
    ],
    choices:[
      {label:'Rahul: "Can I just pick up Humira at the pharmacy today?"'},
      {label:'Rahul: "How serious is RA if we don\'t treat it quickly?"'},
    ],
    followups:[
      [{type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Not quite. Humira is a specialty biologic with a list price over <strong>$6,000/month</strong>. Before any pharmacy can dispense it, your insurance company must formally approve it. That approval process is called <strong>Prior Authorization (PA)</strong> — and it\'s the journey we\'re about to take together.'}],
      [{type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Untreated RA can cause <strong>irreversible joint damage</strong> within the first year in some patients. Early treatment with the right medication significantly slows progression. That urgency is exactly why delays in the PA process aren\'t just administrative frustrations — they have real clinical consequences.'}],
    ]
  },
  {
    messages:[
      {type:'narrator-sep', text:'Dr. Patel\'s office submits the PA request directly to StarCare Health'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'StarCare Health is an <em>illustrative example</em> used throughout this story to represent how a typical payer operates. Here\'s how the PA request flows for a specialty drug like Humira:'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'<div class="flow-box"><span>Dr. Patel (Provider)</span><span class="arr">&#8594;</span><span>PA Request + Clinical Docs</span><span class="arr">&#8594;</span><span>StarCare Health (Payer)</span></div>The provider submits clinical notes, the diagnosis code (ICD-10: M06.09), and the prescription directly to the insurer. The pharmacy is <em>not</em> involved at this stage.'},
      {type:'left',  emoji:'👦', name:'Rahul', text:'So my insurance company gets to decide whether I can have the medication my doctor prescribed?'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'That\'s the core tension of PA. Once StarCare Health approves this request, the PA is <div class="info-box">✅ <strong>Saved permanently on file</strong> — Rahul will NOT need to repeat this PA for Humira while his coverage remains active. A reference number is issued that the pharmacy uses every time.</div>'},
    ],
    choices:[
      {label:'"Why does insurance have approval power over a doctor\'s prescription?"'},
      {label:'"How long does the PA review process actually take?"'},
    ],
    followups:[
      [{type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Insurers require PA for high-cost or clinically complex treatments to verify three things: <strong>(a)</strong> the diagnosis is confirmed, <strong>(b)</strong> the prescribed drug matches an approved indication, and <strong>(c)</strong> lower-cost alternatives were tried first. It\'s a cost and utilization control mechanism — one with significant tradeoffs for patient access.'}],
      [{type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Legally: <strong>72 hours</strong> for urgent requests, up to <strong>15 calendar days</strong> for standard. In practice, many approvals happen in 3–5 business days when documentation is complete. Incomplete submissions are the leading cause of delays — and that\'s exactly what happens in Rahul\'s case.'}],
    ]
  },
  {
    messages:[
      {type:'narrator-sep', text:'Priya explains prior authorization in plain language'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Think of Prior Authorization as your insurance company\'s <strong>formal permission slip</strong>. Before they agree to pay for a high-cost drug or procedure, they review whether it meets their definition of "medically necessary" based on clinical criteria they\'ve established.'},
      {type:'left',  emoji:'👦', name:'Rahul', text:'Is PA purely a cost-cutting tool, or is there a genuine medical rationale?'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Both — and that\'s what makes it complicated. Insurers often require <strong>step therapy</strong>: you must try a cheaper, proven medication first before they\'ll cover the expensive biologic. For many conditions, this is clinically reasonable.<div class="cite">But for aggressive RA, delays caused by mandatory step therapy can directly worsen joint damage during that waiting period — damage that\'s often irreversible.</div>'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'The evidence: <strong>AMA 2023 Prior Authorization Survey</strong> found PA causes treatment delays in the majority of cases surveyed. 1 in 4 physicians reported a PA-related serious adverse event for a patient. <div class="stat-row"><div class="stat-c"><strong>&gt;40</strong><span>PA requests/physician/week (avg)</span></div><div class="stat-c"><strong>~25%</strong><span>Physicians report PA-related adverse events</span></div><div class="stat-c"><strong>72 hrs</strong><span>Urgent review deadline</span></div></div>'},
    ],
    choices:[
      {label:'"Who actually writes the clinical criteria insurers use?"'},
      {label:'"Has PA usage increased over time, or is it stable?"'},
    ],
    followups:[
      [{type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Each insurer\'s medical team develops their own criteria, informed by published clinical guidelines (like ACR guidelines for RA) and their own utilization data. Crucially, criteria differ between payers — the same drug for the same diagnosis might be approved at one insurer and denied at another based on different step therapy requirements.'}],
      [{type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'PA has grown substantially. The AMA reports the average physician\'s PA volume has more than doubled in the past decade. The rise of expensive specialty biologics and gene therapies has driven insurers to apply PA to a much wider range of treatments, turning what was once a narrow review tool into a routine gate for common specialty care.'}],
    ]
  },
  {
    messages:[
      {type:'narrator-sep', text:'StarCare Health\'s clinical review team begins evaluating Rahul\'s submission'},
      {type:'right', emoji:'👧', name:'Priya', text:'Here\'s exactly what the reviewer at StarCare Health checks, step by step:'},
